{
  "description": "A quadrupedal creature shown in right-facing profile against a plain off-white background, with a long tapered snout, small dark eye, stout muscular limbs ending in clawed feet, and a long thick tapering tail that extends out of frame to the left. The dorsal and lateral surfaces of the body, tail, upper legs, and crown of the head are covered in overlapping rounded keratinous scales in dark to medium brown with tan edges, interspersed with patches of larger pale pink scales with fine dark speckling on the mid-back, flank, and shoulder. The skin of the snout, face, lower neck, and lower legs is light tan to gray-brown and wrinkled with fine whiskers around the muzzle. Six bright pink fleshy external gills with fine feathery filaments protrude from the neck region behind the head.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and narrow with a blunt rounded snout, a dark nostril at the tip, fine light whiskers around the muzzle, a small round black eye with a textured eyelid, and light tan wrinkled skin; the dorsal crown is covered in small rounded brown scales",
      "where": "at the front right end of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "a small dark circular ear opening with a slightly raised rim",
      "where": "on the side of the head behind and slightly below the eye, just in front of the lateral gill stalks"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six pink fleshy stalks with dense fine feathery filaments along their length, bright pink with slightly darker tips; three larger stalks protrude laterally from the side of the neck and three smaller stalks protrude dorsally from the top of the neck",
      "where": "clustered around the neck immediately behind the head, on both the side and the top"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four short thick muscular limbs; upper portions covered in overlapping brown scales, lower portions in wrinkled gray-brown skin with a pebbled texture",
      "where": "under the body, two forelimbs under the chest/shoulder and two hindlimbs under the mid-body/hindquarters"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad paws with thick toes ending in curved light tan claws; three prominent claws visible on each forefoot and similar claws on the hindfeet",
      "where": "at the bottom of each leg in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering toward the tip, covered dorsally and laterally in overlapping rounded brown scales in shingled rows",
      "where": "extending to the left from the rear of the body, partially cropped by the left edge of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping rounded keratinous scales in shades of dark brown to medium brown with lighter tan edges, arranged in regular shingled rows; interspersed with clusters of larger pale pinkish scales with fine dark speckles",
      "where": "covering the back, sides, tail, dorsal neck, crown of the head, and upper portions of all four legs; the pale pink clusters are on the mid-back, lower flank, and shoulder"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "irregular patches of pale pink speckled scales contrasting with the surrounding dark brown scales",
      "where": "on the mid-dorsal region, the lower side/flank, and the shoulder area"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "pangolin",
    "axolotl"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0
}
